The fenswood_volcano_template base (its tutorial, README, example controllers, compose files and the
fenswood_drone_controller package scaffold) comes from the Fenswood Volcano template by Arthur Richards for the
University of Bristol Group Project in Aerial Robotics. Its source is at
https://github.com/arthurrichards77/fenswood_volcano_template.

That template is published without a licence, so the MIT licence in this repository does not cover it. The
container images the compose files pull are the University of Bristol Flight Lab's Starling images
(https://github.com/StarlingUAS/ProjectStarling) and keep their own terms.
